OL,3,AMelania Trump brokers truce for Ukraine
OL,4,Acity 'on brink of disaster', White
OL,5,AHouse says
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Oleshky's remaining population is
OL,8,Fcomprised primarily of elderly
OL,9,Fresidents who urgently need medical
OL,10,Fattention, medicine, food, and clean
OL,11,Fwater," it added.
OL,13,FOleshky, in the Kherson region, was
OL,14,Fseized by Russian forces during the
OL,15,Ffirst days of Moscow's full-scale
OL,16,Finvasion in February 2022. Remaining
OL,17,Fresidents have recently resorted to
OL,18,Feating garden weeds to survive.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
